# Public showcase assets explicitly approved for this repository. Keep this
# allowlist exact so newly generated production media remains ignored.
!examples/posters/boundaries.jpg
!examples/posters/highly-sensitive.jpg
!examples/posters/no-people-pleasing.jpg
!examples/posters/original-family.jpg
!examples/videos/boundaries.mp4
